, typically worn by army commanders and leaders."},"defenceVal":"8","hp":"360","price":"7500","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1019205","name":{"zh":"毛胄","en":"Fur Helm"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"采用了与铁札甲类似的工序锻造的头盔，并带有兽毛作为装饰，多为北方游牧民族佩戴。","en":"A helmet forged in a process similar to lamellar armor, trimmed with animal fur, commonly worn by northern nomadic peoples."},"defenceVal":"2","price":"800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001015","name":{"zh":"汗血","en":"Sweatblood"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"西域进贡的纯种汗血宝马，皮肤薄，血管可见，冲刺时如流血汗。","en":"A purebred blood-sweating horse presented as tribute from the Western Regions, with thin skin and visible veins that appear to sweat blood at full gallop."},"price":"10000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{},"clans":[{"id":"GI110515","name":{"zh":"鲜卑轲比氏","en":"The Kebi clan of the Xianbei"},"years":["0","235"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑为东胡别支。轲比能本为小种鲜卑，以勇健、执法公平被推举为大人。鲜卑首领轲比能，建安年间向曹操进贡，魏文帝封附义王。轲比能统一漠南，控弦十余万骑，屡犯魏边，为幽、并大患。青龙三年，幽州刺史王雄派刺客韩龙将其刺杀，鲜卑政权瓦解。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, of which the Xianbei were an offshoot. Kebineng originally hailed from a minor Xianbei branch and was chosen as chieftain for his martial valor and fair enforcement of laws. During the Jian'an era, the Xianbei chieftain Kebineng paid tribute to Cao Cao, and Emperor Wen of Wei enfeoffed him as the King of Fuyi. Kebineng unified the lands South of the Gobi, commanding over 100,000 mounted archers, and repeatedly raided Wei's borders, becoming a grave menace to You and Bing Provinces. In the third year of Qinglong, Wang Xiong, Inspector of You Province, sent the assassin Han Long to slay him, leading to the collapse of the Xianbei regime."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"3","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"郁筑鞬","height":"平均","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{